\nDepartment: Unisex\nFormulation: Cream\nIngredients: Shea Butter Vitamin E Vanilla\nItem Weight: 2 lb\nMain Purpose: Moisturizing Nourishing\nSet Includes: Hand Cream\nUnit Quantity: 12\nCountry of Origin: Korea\nActive Ingredients: Shea Butter Vitamin E",
